* ============================================================================
* 20_collab_clarity_robustness.do — v3.5.1 A1 Lexical Clarity Robustness (P5 Table A7)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Anchor: Loughran & McDonald (2011, JF 66:1); You et al. (2018) hhx055; 真双轨.
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear
set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* Panel A: clarity × collab_mode 交互
capture confirm variable mean_clarity_score_full
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} c.mean_clarity_score_full##c.{{MAIN_TREAT}} $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id year)
    eststo collab_clarity_interact
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] mean_clarity_score_full not in panel (v3.5.1 D5 pending)"
}

* Panel B: 双轨主效应 (full / ctx 同表)
* 白话: full 轨与 ctx 轨的清晰度得分一起放进回归 — 两轨互为稳健性, 验证结论不依赖归因窗口。
capture confirm variable mean_clarity_score_full
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} mean_clarity_score_full mean_clarity_score_ctx $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id year)
    eststo collab_clarity_dual
}

* fix(audit-2026-06-16, S6-collab-03): esttab 名单动态化 — collab_clarity_interact /
* collab_clarity_dual 均在 `capture confirm variable mean_clarity_score_full` 守卫块内
* (清晰度列缺失即跳过), 旧版硬点名缺名 → r(111) 丢整表。镜像 15_collab_main_regression。
* 白话: 出表时只点名实际估计成功的模型, 防止某一列缺席导致整张表报错丢失。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models collab_clarity_interact collab_clarity_dual
local models ""
foreach m of local cand_models {
    if `: list m in stored' local models `models' `m'
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display "  [WARN] no clarity estimates stored (mean_clarity_score_full absent) — skipping Table A7"
}
else {
    esttab `models' ///
        using "$tables_dir/tableA7_clarity_robustness.tex", ///
        se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) replace ///
        title("Table A7: Lexical Clarity × Collab Mode — {{PAPER_ID}}")
}
